# GOAL: the registered conf-watchdog route runs its real wire assertions through
# the selected executable, including a non-le basename and a path with spaces.
# METHOD: the compiled fixture checks wrong-build refusal, shadows PATH with a
# refusing le, then runs the actual compatibility case and reads captured frames.
# accept-only: the compiled fixture returns an error for every failed assertion
option=timeout:value=90s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture ui/conf-watchdog-executable-identity
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS: conf-watchdog wire assertions through selected renamed executable and spaced argv
